# XINC1 pop-mismatch, read by hand (group 4): callers popgen.py lists as manual (docs/PATCHES.md, "Pop-mismatch
# families"). Each callee's `ret N` in the byte-exact MSVC objects says which call pops which pushed words; the decomp
# gave them to a getter (or a virtual getter) whose result the next call uses. Applies after xinc1_pop_gen.s1b.

